menu "ULANI BLE"

config ULANI_BLE_INITIATE_SECURITY
    bool "Initiate pairing after connecting"
    default y
    help
        The reference Node.js implementation requires the calendar to have been
        paired through the host OS first, which suggests the device expects an
        encrypted link. Enable this to have the ESP32 start pairing itself right
        after connecting. Failure is logged but not treated as fatal, so it is
        safe to leave on while you find out what your unit actually wants.

config ULANI_BLE_CHUNK_GAP_MS
    int "Delay between image data packets (ms)"
    default 20
    range 0 200
    help
        The reference implementation waits 20 ms between the 230-byte writes
        that make up an image. Raising this makes a transfer slower but can help
        if the panel drops packets while WiFi is busy.

endmenu
